{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103420","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710342001:1":{"text":"ガァ！グワッグワッ！グァ！","source_cn":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6838B7ACC5E169B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710342002:1":{"text":"この子は、ロワンさんのペットの……？でもなぜここに。それに、すごく焦っているようです。","source_cn":"这是……罗万的那只宠物？它怎么会独自跑来这里？而且看起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D4D250497D46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710342003:1":{"text":"グワッグワッ！グァ！ガァー！","source_cn":"嘎嘎！咕嘎！呜——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D30F18C67B60258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710342004:1":{"text":"私たちに何か伝えたいようですが、何を言っているのかまったく分かりませんね……","source_cn":"它好像有很重要的话想对我们说，但我完全听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DC5DCD7D029504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710342005:1":{"text":"ふむふむ……なるほどねぇ……","source_cn":"嗯嗯……原来是这么回事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A98544920DA3A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},